@startuml
title Learn a business decision graph
start
:Find an annotated decision entry;
:Attribute source symbols and types;
:Start from every returned value;
:Walk backwards through data dependencies;
:Add result-relevant conditions and computations;
if (Call target known?) then (yes)
  :Include its relevant decision slice;
else (multiple possibilities)
  :Add candidate decision-rule branches;
endif
if (Relevant construct unsupported?) then (yes)
  :Add visible coverage gap;
endif
:Publish graph and separate correlation manifest;
stop
@enduml
